OL,3,AHome Alone and Schitt's Creek stars
OL,4,Atribute to late on-screen 'mom' O'Hara
OL,5,
OL,6,FMacaulay Culkin, Annie Murphy and Dan
OL,7,FLevy delivered a poignant tribute to
OL,8,Ftheir late Home Alone and Schitt's
OL,9,FCreek co-star and on-screen mother,
OL,10,FCatherine O'Hara, at the Emmy Awards
OL,12,FCulkin remembered her as "our momma",
OL,13,Fand "like a good mom, she always showed
OL,14,Fup when I asked her to", he said.
OL,16,FUS singer-songwriter Noah Kahan
OL,17,Fperformed Bridge Over Troubled Water
OL,18,Fduring the in memoriam segment on the
OL,19,Fnight, before Jamie Lee Curtis paid
OL,20,Fanother emotional tribute to the late
OL,21,Factor and director Rob Reiner.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
